			x: 10.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["64F01001238ACD74"]
			description: [
				"Natural gas desulfurizes into refinery gas, and the distillery pulls methane, ethane, propane, butane and helium out of it."
				"The methane goes to the PTFE line two steps on."
