		{
			dependencies: ["35719B747A75F7B6"]
			description: [
				"Dimethylhydrazine comes out of methanol, ammonia and hypochlorous acid in a chemical reactor, and the mixer blends it with oxygen. Hydrogen also burns in the rocket, but it runs out far sooner."
				"The syngas plant is the easy way to the hydrogen for the ammonia. A Moon launch needs at least 8 buckets of rocket fuel in the tanks."
			]
