		{
			dependencies: ["35719B747A75F7B6"]
			description: [
				"Fill the &6Space Chestplate&r with oxygen in a fluid canner before you leave: an empty suit drowns you on the Moon."
				"The suit is four pieces, and the lunar cold gets through any piece you leave at home."
			]
